sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as Learner
  participant W as Web
  participant A as API (DocumentsService)
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant S as Object storage
  participant R as Redis (BullMQ)
  U->>W: chọn file
  W->>W: tính SHA-256, suy MIME từ đuôi file
  W->>A: POST /courses/:courseId/documents/upload-url { filename, mimeType, sizeBytes, checksumSha256 }
  A->>D: Course thuộc userId? (repository lọc ownerId)
  A->>A: resolveUploadMime · sizeBytes ≤ 25 MB
  A->>D: trùng checksum trong Course (bỏ qua bản PENDING)?
  A->>A: assertNotExceeded(DOCUMENTS_UPLOADED) — chỉ kiểm, chưa trừ
  A->>D: INSERT Document (PENDING, storageKey ngẫu nhiên)
  A->>S: ký presigned PUT (Content-Type, Content-Length = sizeBytes, 15 phút)
  A-->>W: 200 { documentId, uploadUrl, expiresInSec }
  W->>S: PUT file trực tiếp (không đi qua API)
  S-->>W: 200
  W->>A: POST /documents/:id/confirm { sizeBytes }
  A->>D: consume(DOCUMENTS_UPLOADED) + status = UPLOADED (transaction)
  A->>R: add document-extract (jobId extract-{id}, attempts 3, backoff mũ)
  A-->>W: 200 Document (UPLOADED)
  W->>A: GET /courses/:courseId/documents (invalidate query sau confirm)
  A-->>W: danh sách kèm status, pageCount, chunkCount, errorMessage
